 Schlüchtern area are disrupting rail service between Frankfurt (Main) Central Station and Fulda."}],"displayPriority":20,"disruptionCommunicationID":"c7a0997a-1cb2-4440-8773-4c63cf14680d","disruptionID":"a9a83db7-320e-4b96-a99f-13ea559c1166","effect":"IMPAIRMENT","messageID":1},{"cause":"CONSTRUCTION","descriptions":[{"language":"deu","links":[{"label":"PLAKAT","url":"https://him.static-bahn.de/1792677997075_26_12_S1_S2_Griesheim.pdf"}],"text":"Auf der S1 und S2 kommt es zwischen Hochheim(Main) / Niedernhausen(Taunus) - Frankfurt-Höchst - Frankfurt-Griesheim - Offenbach(Main)Ost - Rödermark-Ober Roden / Dietzenbach Bahnhof bis zum 12.12.26 zu Haltausfällen, Teil- und Zugausfällen. Der Grund sind Bauarbeiten. Der Halt Frankfurt-Griesheim wird in Richtung der Frankfurter Innenstadt nur Montags bis Samstags, tagsüber, im 30-Minuten-Takt von der S1 bedient. Aufgrund weiterer Baumaßnahmen, können diese Züge an einigen Tagen komplett ausfallen und somit auch nicht in Frankfurt-Griesheim halten. Die S1 verkehrt im 30-Minuten-Takt sowie im 15-Minuten-Takt zwischen Rödermark-Ober-Roden - Frankfurt-Höchst. Die S2 verkehrt im 30-Minuten-Takt sowie im 15-Minuten-Takt zwischen Dietzenbach Bahnhof - Offenbach(Main)Ost (endet/beginnt in Offenbach(Main)Hbf) sowie zwischen Frankfurt-Höchst - Hofheim(Taunus). Nutzen Sie alternativ von/nach Frankfurt-Griesheim auch die Züge der Gegenrichtung.","textShort":"S1 und S2 zwischen Frankfurt-Höchst - Frankfurt-Griesheim - Offenbach(Main)Ost - Rödermark-Ober Roden / Dietzenbach Bahnhof bis zum 12.12.26 kommt es zu Haltausfällen, Teil- und Zugausfällen. Grund: Bauarbeiten."},{"language":"eng","links":[{"label":"POSTER (DE)","url":"https://him.static-bahn.de/1792677997075_26_12_S1_S2_Griesheim.pdf"}],"text":"On the S1 and S2 lines, service will be suspended between Hochheim (Main) / Niedernhausen(Taunus) – Frankfurt-Höchst – Frankfurt-Griesheim – Offenbach (Main) Ost – Rödermark-Ober Roden / Dietzenbach Station until December 12, 2026. This is due to construction work. The Frankfurt-Griesheim stop is served by the S1 in the direction of downtown Frankfurt only Monday through Saturday during the day, at 30-minute intervals. Due to additional construction work, these trains may be completely canceled on some days and therefore will not stop at Frankfurt-Griesheim. The S1 runs every 30 minutes and every 15 minutes between Rödermark-Ober-Roden and Frankfurt-Höchst. The S2 runs every 30 minutes and every 15 minutes between Dietzenbach Bahnhof and Offenbach (Main) Ost (ending/beginning at Offenbach (Main) Hbf) as well as between Frankfurt-Höchst and Hofheim (Taunus). Alternatively, you can also use trains traveling in the opposite direction to and from Frankfurt-Griesheim.","textShort":"On lines S1 and S2 between Frankfurt-Höchst, Frankfurt-Griesheim, Offenbach (Main) Ost, and Rödermark-Ober Roden / Dietzenbach Station, there will be skipped stops, partial service, and train cancellations through December 12, 2026. Reason: Construction work."}],"displayPriority":60,"disruptionCommunicationID":"1b76ebdd-b78a-4b3c-8d9e-14d651bbd85c","disruptionID":"e2c59359-4359-423b-9c76-716d1a7e21fd","effect":"OTHER_EFFECT","messageID":2},{"cause":"TECHNICAL_PROBLEM_RAILWAY_SECTION","descriptions":[{"language":"deu","links":[{"label":"Zur Störungskarte","url":"https://karte.bahn.de/detail/8ff926d7-fc3c-4eff-a754-4c6fa73a68eb"}],"text":"Auf der S1, S2, S8 und S9 kommt es zu Verspätungen sowie zu Teil- und Zugausfällen. Der Grund ist ein defektes Stellwerk. Die S1 verkehrt zwischen Frankfurt-Höchst - Rödermark-Ober Roden im 30-Minuten-Takt. Die S2 verkehrt zwischen Offenbach(Main)Hbf - Dietzenbach Bahnhof im 30-Minuten-Takt. Bitte rechnen Sie auf der S8 und S9 mit Verspätungen und einzelnen Teilausfällen.","textShort":"S1, S2, S8 und S9: Es kommt zu Verspätungen sowie zu Teil- und Zugausfällen. Der Grund ist ein defektes Stellwerk."},{"language":"eng","links":[{"label":"Go to the Outage Map (DE)","url":"https://karte.bahn.de/detail/8ff926d7-fc3c-4eff-a754-4c6fa73a68eb"}],"text":"There are delays, as well as partial and complete service cancellations, on the S1, S2, S8, and S9 lines. The cause is a malfunctioning signal box. The S1 is running every 30 minutes between Frankfurt-Höchst and Rödermark-Ober Roden. The S2 is running every 30 minutes between Offenbach (Main) Hbf and Dietzenbach Bahnhof. Please expect delays and occasional service disruptions on the S8 and S9 lines.","textShort":"S1, S2, S8, and S9: There are delays, as well as partial and complete train cancellations. The cause is a malfunctioning signal box."}],"displayPriority":20,"disruptionCommunicationID":"beaa1058-1240-4578-a456-b3a2574f60d0","disruptionID":"f1344900-93a4-433e-9bd9-e98440abbf83","effect":"IMPAIRMENT","messageID":3},{"cause":"TECHNICAL_PROBLEM_RAILWAY_SECTION","descriptions":[{"language":"deu","text":"Eine Reparatur an einem Signal zwischen Frankfurt(M) Flughafen Fernbf und Köln Hbf beeinträchtigt den Bahnverkehr. In der Folge kommt es zu Verspätungen. Bitte prüfen Sie Ihre Reiseverbindung kurz vor Abfahrt des Zuges.","textShort":"Eine Reparatur an einem Signal zwischen Frankfurt(M) Flughafen Fernbf und Köln Hbf beeinträchtigt den Bahnverkehr."},{"language":"eng","text":"Repair work on a signal between Frankfurt (M) Airport Long-Distance Bus Terminal and Cologne Central Station is disrupting rail service. This is causing delays. Please check your travel itinerary shortly before the train's departure.","textShort":"Repair work on a signal between Frankfurt (M) Airport Long-Distance Bus Terminal and Cologne Central Station is disrupting rail service."}],"displayPriority":20,"disruptionCommunicationID":"06bdb2e3-99f6-4f25-9643-f8cb66f0b085","disruptionID":"18fa4bc2-0060-4971-a509-d4095fa09488","effect":"IMPAIRMENT","messageID":4}],"notes":[{"descriptions":[{"language":"deu","text":"Keine Be-/Entladung von Fahrrädern in Nürnberg Hbf möglich.","textShort":"Keine Be-/Entladung von Fahrrädern in Nürnberg Hbf möglich."},{"language":"eng","text":"No loading/unloading of bicycles possible at Nuremberg main station.","textShort":"No loading/unloading of bicycles possible at Nuremberg main station."}],"displayPriority":60,"disruptionCommunicationID":"2175c07a-a510-4340-b819-fdf187d96cfc","disruptionID":"8c7252dd-443c-485d-819b-58ba5c966a73","messageID":5},{"descriptions":[{"language":"deu","text":"Kein behindertengerechtes WC in Wagen 35. Mobilitätseingeschränkte Reisende wenden sich bzgl. eventuell erforderlicher Umbuchungen an unsere Mobilitätsservice-Zentrale.","textShort":"Kein behindertengerechtes WC in Wagen 35. Bei erforderlichen Umbuchungen an Mobilitätsservice-Zentrale wenden."},{"language":"eng","text":"There is no accessible restroom in car 35. Passengers with limited mobility should contact our Mobility Service Center regarding any necessary rebookings.","textShort":"There is no accessible restroom in car 35. If you need to make any changes to your reservation, please contact the Mobility Service Center."}],"displayPriority":60,"disruptionCommunicationID":"e2ab5294-823c-4f17-bd55-2fc9076a7471","disruptionID":"cfdb2a69-37fb-435c-9587-7bd91df97354","messageID":6}],"risCauseCodes":[{"code":"43","descriptions":[{"language":"deu","text":"Verspätung eines vorausfahrenden Zuges"}],"messageID":9},{"code":"48","descriptions":[{"language":"deu","text":"Verspätung aus vorheriger Fahrt"}],"messageID":12},{"code":"38","descriptions":[{"language":"deu","text":"Reparatur an der Strecke"}],"messageID":13},{"code":"45","descriptions":[{"language":"deu","text":"Vorfahrt eines anderen Zuges"}],"messageID":16},{"code":"34","descriptions":[{"language":"deu","text":"Reparatur an einem Signal"}],"messageID":17},{"code":"54","descriptions":[{"language":"deu","text":"Verfügbarkeit der Gleise derzeit eingeschränkt"}],"messageID":18}]},"meta":{"consideredStopPlaces":["100010","107011","8000105","8089211","8089505","8098105"],"truncatedTransportTypes":["CITY_TRAIN","HIGH_SPEED_TRAIN","REGIONAL_TRA